## If you cannot proceed

{% if can_ask_questions %}
If continuing would mean guessing, reply with one line — `BLOCKED: <question>` —
and nothing else. An open question you can work around is not a blocker.
{% else %}
The plan in `.ai/context/plan.md` is human-approved; its decisions are final. If the
plan contains a section recording decisions (for example under *Decisions* or
*Open questions*), those decisions are the answer — do not ask for them to be
confirmed.

Reply with `BLOCKED: <question>` only when you discover a genuine contradiction
**while reading the code** — not because you have not read the plan or the files
yet. An open question you can work around is not a blocker.
{% endif %}
